WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.124
Open the app's Analytics page. Total Uses, Total
Discount Given and Orders Affected describe recorded

2
00:00:06.124 --> 00:00:10.616
discount activity; Active Campaigns describes
configuration. These are not interchangeable measures

3
00:00:10.616 --> 00:00:18.373
of conversion. Our demo has one active campaign and no
processed discount orders, so No data yet is expected.

4
00:00:18.373 --> 00:00:26.539
We do not create a customer order just to fill a
chart. A dash means missing reported data, not an

5
00:00:26.539 --> 00:00:27.764
estimated revenue figure.

6
00:00:28.814 --> 00:00:35.255
Use Campaign Performance to compare the reported uses,
discount amount and last-used information for each

7
00:00:35.255 --> 00:00:41.696
campaign. The page explains that data comes from
processed orders and that historical orders before

8
00:00:41.696 --> 00:00:48.995
installation are not included. Adding products to a
cart or opening checkout is not an order-use record.

9
00:00:48.995 --> 00:00:56.295
For a disputed result, compare the saved campaign,
actual order lines and applied discounts. Do not treat

10
00:00:56.295 --> 00:01:01.447
this table as session replay, acquisition attribution
or proof of incremental sales.

11
00:01:02.497 --> 00:01:09.001
In Plans and Billing, start with the offer you need.
Free covers core percentage offers within its campaign

12
00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:15.505
allowance. Starter adds capabilities such as codes and
Buy X Get Y; Pro adds more advanced gifts and

13
00:01:15.505 --> 00:01:21.286
targeting. Read the actual current comparison and
limits here. This is a development store with test

14
00:01:21.286 --> 00:01:27.428
access, not evidence that a real merchant has
subscribed or been charged. No plan purchase is made

15
00:01:27.428 --> 00:01:28.512
in this recording.

16
00:01:29.562 --> 00:01:36.899
MTD Plus is the app subscription; Shopify Plus is the
store's platform plan. Supported checkout mystery

17
00:01:36.899 --> 00:01:43.319
needs the relevant app entitlement, an eligible
Shopify Plus store and the displayed configuration

18
00:01:43.319 --> 00:01:50.198
requirements. Buying the app plan cannot turn a
non-Plus Shopify store into Plus. Review Shopify's

19
00:01:50.198 --> 00:01:57.077
actual confirmation, price and trial terms before
approving any charge. Finish by matching the chosen

20
00:01:57.077 --> 00:02:03.955
features to one tested offer; upgrade decisions should
not replace correct campaign setup and checkout

21
00:02:03.955 --> 00:02:04.414
checks.
